, wilful misconduct or fraud, and its infringement of the other party's intellectual property rights. Licensee's payment obligations under this Agreement are not damages for purposes of this Article XIII.\",\"numbering\":\"(d)\"}],\"comment\":\"[Playbook] As drafted only Licensor is protected and its cap is one half of amounts paid, leaving our liability unlimited under the Article XII indemnity, so we made the exclusion and cap mutual at the greater of fees paid or payable in the 12 months preceding the claim and USD 1,000,000. New paragraph (d) places confidentiality, data protection, security, indemnification, gross negligence, wilful misconduct, fraud and IP infringement outside those limits and confirms our payment obligations are not damages; the IP exculpation in (a) is now subject to the same carve-out.\",\"level\":\"preferred\",\"summary\":\"Make the damages exclusion and liability cap mutual, reset the cap to the greater of 12 months' fees and USD 1,000,000, and add uncapped Excluded Claims plus payment-obligation carve-out.\"},\"elementCoverage\":{\"level\":\"preferred\",\"mappings\":[{\"element\":\"Mutual cap.\",\"status\":\"addressed_by_operation\",\"operationIndexes\":[2]},{\"element\":\"Cap equal to the greater of fees paid or payable in the 12 months preceding the claim and USD 1,000,000.\",\"status\":\"addressed_by_operation\",\"operationIndexes\":[2]},{\"element\":\"Mutual exclusion of indirect damages.\",\"status\":\"addressed_by_operation\",\"operationIndexes\":[1]},{\"element\":\"Mutual exclusion of consequential damages.\",\"status\":\"addressed_by_operation\",\"operationIndexes\":[1]},{\"element\":\"Uncapped breach of confidentiality obligations.\",\"status\":\"addressed_by_operation\",\"operationIndexes\":[4]},{\"element\":\"Uncapped breach of data protection obligations.\",\"status\":\"addressed_by_operation\",\"operationIndexes\":[4]},{\"element\":\"Uncapped breach of security obligations.\",\"status\":\"addressed_by_operation\",\"operation